{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30909","headline":"送皇甫协律淮南从事 · 马戴","name":"送皇甫协律淮南从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟书丞相草，招作广陵行。\n隋柳疎淮岸，汀洲接海城。\n楚樯经雨泊，烟月隔潮生。\n谁与同尊俎，鸡鸾集虎营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}